
==================== 0. Which config is in use? ====================

$ rclone config file                    # RCLONE_CONFIG="" -> no file at all
Configuration is in memory only

$ env | grep ^RCLONE_S3_ | sed "s/=.*/=<set>/"   # settings come from the environment
RCLONE_S3_PROVIDER=<set>
RCLONE_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=<set>
RCLONE_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=<set>
RCLONE_S3_ENDPOINT=<set>

==================== 1. Create buckets ====================

$ rclone mkdir :s3:videos

$ rclone mkdir :s3:backups

$ rclone lsd :s3:                       # list buckets
          -1 2026-11-02 10:17:20        -1 backups
          -1 2026-11-02 10:17:19        -1 videos

==================== 2. Upload ====================

$ rclone copy data/source :s3:videos -v --stats-one-line
